b2_explainability_1,"The recommended funding allocation for our school's STEM programs seems lower than expected, what specific factors led to this suggestion and how were they weighted?","The recommended funding allocation for your school's STEM programs is determined by a complex interplay of factors. While I don't have access to the specific details of your school's budgeting process, I can provide a general overview of the common factors that typically influence funding allocation decisions. Please note that the weights assigned to each factor may vary depending on the institution and the decision-making process.

